    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="25">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 25</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe tyhtbysig sy ⁊ folce ungetreowe ⁊ ðas gemot forbuga ðríwa, ðonne sceawie man of ðam feorðan gemote ða ðe him to ridan, ⁊ finde ðone gyt borh, gyf he mæge.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone who is of bad reputation and unworthy of public confidence fails to attend the court-meetings three times, men shall be chosen from the fourth meeting who shall ride to him, and he may then still find a surety, if he can.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And se ðe tyhtbysig sig ⁊ folce ungetrywe ⁊ þas gemot forbuge þriwa: þonne sceawie man of þam feorðan gemote þa ðe him to ridan; ⁊ finde þonne gyt borh, gif he mæge.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
